@startuml 05-implantacao
skinparam shadowing false

title Deployment — examples (local Docker, edge, optional cloud)

node "Development machine" as Dev {
  artifact "docker compose\n(code/docker-compose.yml)" as DC
  node "frontend container\n:3000→80" as Cfe
  node "backend container\n:8080" as Cbe
  artifact "volume backend → ./backend" as Vol
}

node "Raspberry Pi / PiCarX" as Pi {
  artifact "venv + publish_picarx_dht22.py" as Agen
  artifact "systemd unit\n(local or remote)" as Sysd
}

node "Cloud (optional)\nGCP Cloud Run / App Engine" as Cloud {
  artifact "Docker images / static build" as Img
}

cloud "Network (LAN / Internet)" as Net

Cfe -down- Cbe : bridge iot-network
Vol .. Cbe
DC .. Cfe
DC .. Cbe

Agen .. Net
Cbe .. Net : **api/ingest** and **GET** data
Sysd .. Agen : start / restart agent
Img .. Net : same HTTP contract if remote deploy

note bottom of Cloud
  Frontend and backend may ship separately;
  the Pi publisher uses **PUBLISH_URL**
  pointing at the public endpoint or VPN.
end note

@enduml
